CHAPTER.VERS:
And he says to them, Don't be amazed: you

          {+}
         seek Jesus, the Nazarene, who has been crucified: he is risen; he is not here: look, the place where they laid him!

But go, tell his disciples and Peter, He goes before you

          {+}
         into Galilee: there you

          {+}
         will see him, as he said to you

          {+}
        .
